# Shipped font bakes -- consumed by the ship pipeline's cook stage (dev_ship).
#
#   <family> <size_px> [-sdf[=n]] [-range=<spec>]
#
# <family> is a font_tool input: a TTF in assets/font_source, or an OS-installed face name
# (wrap names containing spaces in double quotes).  A family in an assets/font_source
# subdirectory must include its extension (e.g. jetbrains/JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular.ttf) --
# a bare name only auto-tries .ttf/.otf/.ttc when it has no directory component.  Flags pass
# through to font_tool verbatim.
# Each line bakes one .orb_font into assets/font/ (FreeType quality), which the stage step
# ships wholesale.  The gui font resolver finds these by filename, so a size listed here is
# available to shipped builds (which install no runtime baker).

# assets/font_source/

jetbrains/JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular.ttf 12
jetbrains/JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular.ttf 16
jetbrains/JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular.ttf 20
jetbrains/JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular.ttf 24
jetbrains/JetBrainsMonoNL-Regular.ttf 32
roboto/Roboto-Regular.ttf 12
roboto/Roboto-Regular.ttf 16
roboto/Roboto-Regular.ttf 20
roboto/Roboto-Regular.ttf 24
roboto/Roboto-Regular.ttf 32

# windows installed 

CascadiaMono 12
CascadiaMono 16
CascadiaMono 20
CascadiaMono 24
CascadiaMono 32
CascadiaCode 16
